  "uncertainty": "As of 2026-10-04, the supplied dossier establishes CBS Broadcasting Inc. as KPIX-TV's FCC licensee and identifies CBS, through CBS News and Stations, as its operating organization. It does not establish the legal ownership links upward from CBS Broadcasting Inc. Although one source calls Paramount the parent of CBS, that does not document the licensee's complete corporate chain or establish Paramount Skydance Corporation as the ultimate parent. The controlling person and current CEO of Paramount Skydance Corporation are not established. Associated Broadcasters is identified only as a historical owner; Scott Warren and Jennifer Mitchell are identified in station or divisional leadership roles, not the requested CEO role."
